  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8201;</mo><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8201;</mo><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math><br />hence,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is a tautology<br />Now,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is false when <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></math> is true and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></math> is false<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8201;</mo><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>&#8201;</mo><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is correct.<br />Also,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is false when <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></math> is true and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></math> is false<br />Also,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8660;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is false when <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></math> is true and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></math> is false"
  }
